# LokiAI Main v1.2 — root ignore rules (FND-001)
# Scope: exclude dependency folders, generated/build output, caches, temp files,
# logs, IDE/OS files, and local environment files. Never exclude source,
# documentation, assets, configuration, package manifests, or dependency
# lockfiles — those must remain tracked.

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/target/
**/coverage/
**/out/

# Caches and temporary files
**/.cache/
**/.turbo/
**/.vite/
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/.tmp/

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# IDE / editor files
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/.idea/

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# Environment files (retain the committed example)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Excluded working note (not part of the tracked engineering document set)
/PromptForYou.md

# Additional generated Rust build directories
**/target-*/
**/target_scratch/
